(7188991, 1105410, 12611, '<td valign="top">There is something crazy going on with the processing of the leaf branch area, and in the context of the shot it works very well. I also think the low flat aspect, coupled with the flame-like trees against a powdery sky, creates a very pleasing feel, a terrific softness in the midst of the trees "dancing" for the viewer''s pleaure. super job.</td>', 'There is something crazy going on with the processing of the leaf branch area, and in the context of the shot it works very well. I also think the low flat aspect, coupled with the flame-like trees against a powdery sky, creates a very pleasing feel, a terrific softness in the midst of the trees "dancing" for the viewer''s pleaure. super job.', '2014-03-12 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
