(7190397, 1105314, 11769, '<td valign="top">don''t slouch</td>', 'don''t slouch', '2014-03-16 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190403, 1105353, 138630, '<td valign="top">Bump, bump, bump tonight.  My top pick and only 10.  This is the kind of triad I would have loved to get - the man, the ax, the tree = the title.  And your compositional balance is so very fine.  Love the bokeh background, too.  I''m afraid I won''t see this anywhere near as high as I think it deserves to be - the interpretation consensus is so clearly three same or nearly same subjects.  Too bad and I hope to be proved wrong.</td>', 'Bump, bump, bump tonight.  My top pick and only 10.  This is the kind of triad I would have loved to get - the man, the ax, the tree = the title.  And your compositional balance is so very fine.  Love the bokeh background, too.  I''m afraid I won''t see this anywhere near as high as I think it deserves to be - the interpretation consensus is so clearly three same or nearly same subjects.  Too bad and I hope to be proved wrong.', '2014-03-16 22:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190404, 1104983, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top three.  Love the pattern created by the three groups of three.  One thing that would have improved this would have been the use of 3-tined forks but I don''t have any, either LOL</td>', 'Top three.  Love the pattern created by the three groups of three.  One thing that would have improved this would have been the use of 3-tined forks but I don''t have any, either LOL', '2014-03-16 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190406, 1104925, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top three.  I love a good find and this is terrific.  One more bag or object by the guy on the right and it would be perfect.  I mean look at how they all have the backpack or briefcase on their right and their attention riveted on their work (or play) and even the laptops appear to be the same or almost.  Love the way the beams frame them, too.  I probably would have changed the color of the green signs - desaturated them or something - or maybe gone all bw.  Love it, though.</td>', 'Top three.  I love a good find and this is terrific.  One more bag or object by the guy on the right and it would be perfect.  I mean look at how they all have the backpack or briefcase on their right and their attention riveted on their work (or play) and even the laptops appear to be the same or almost.  Love the way the beams frame them, too.  I probably would have changed the color of the green signs - desaturated them or something - or maybe gone all bw.  Love it, though.', '2014-03-16 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190408, 1105297, 138630, '<td valign="top">So nicely caught in terms of timing.  The title works but the visual impact is such that it was not necessary - and I love the way the strong shadows frame the figures and repeat their strides.  8</td>', 'So nicely caught in terms of timing.  The title works but the visual impact is such that it was not necessary - and I love the way the strong shadows frame the figures and repeat their strides.  8', '2014-03-16 23:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190409, 1104991, 138630, '<td valign="top">Like this a lot - its simplicity, palette and processing appeal to me.  Glad the "vases" are different colors.  Nice.  8<br/> <br/>edited to remove an apostrophe :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-17 00:08:05.</i></td>', 'Like this a lot - its simplicity, palette and processing appeal to me.  Glad the "vases" are different colors.  Nice.  8 edited to remove an apostrophe :)', '2014-03-16 23:06:39.000000', '2014-03-17 00:08:05.000000', 1),
(7190411, 1105405, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the clean, contemporary look to both the stools and the paneling.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'I like the clean, contemporary look to both the stools and the paneling.  Nicely done.  8', '2014-03-16 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7190412, 1105394, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the Old World feel here and the tones.  A little too much space for me, especially above the grouping - but it would look really funny cropped narrower, too, I think, given the subject.  One of my favorites.  8</td>', 'I like the Old World feel here and the tones.  A little too much space for me, especially above the grouping - but it would look really funny cropped narrower, too, I think, given the subject.  One of my favorites.  8', '2014-03-16 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
