(7190771, 1105406, 77196, '<td valign="top">Have to admit I didn''t get it. Partially because I was looking for human girls. I didn''t even see the right dog''s nose. Once I saw your description of "drinking from", it clicked.</td>', 'Have to admit I didn''t get it. Partially because I was looking for human girls. I didn''t even see the right dog''s nose. Once I saw your description of "drinking from", it clicked.', '2014-03-17 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
