(7190776, 1104956, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the way the clouds are tangled in the trees. The light is excellent, the composition &amp; color very eye-catching. Wish I''d seen this on the front page!</td>', 'I like the way the clouds are tangled in the trees. The light is excellent, the composition & color very eye-catching. Wish I''d seen this on the front page!', '2014-03-17 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7190778, 1105394, 104230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Mary Ann. Wonderful light, textures, and tones.</td>', 'Congratulations Mary Ann. Wonderful light, textures, and tones.', '2014-03-17 11:32:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7190783, 1104921, 124190, '<td valign="top">oh my....where are you going?</td>', 'oh my....where are you going?', '2014-03-17 12:36:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7190932, 1105394, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... although I LOVE to see beautiful art recognized (and this is definitely beautiful art)... and you KNOW that I love your work, Mary Ann...   <br/> <br/>If someone asked me to look at this image and tell what it''s of, I''d say, "Three bulbs and a bowl."<br/> <br/>The challenge description said to have three subjects present... all equal in visual importance.  I see four subjects, so... soo...  <br/> <br/>So... *cringe* I''m sorry to have to admit that I gave you a 5 during voting... but I give you big congratulations for such a well done shot now.  The technicals are wonderful... the composition exquisite and the visual appeal is... a 12.  :D<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your ribbon! <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hmmm... although I LOVE to see beautiful art recognized (and this is definitely beautiful art)... and you KNOW that I love your work, Mary Ann...    If someone asked me to look at this image and tell what it''s of, I''d say, "Three bulbs and a bowl." The challenge description said to have three subjects present... all equal in visual importance.  I see four subjects, so... soo...   So... *cringe* I''m sorry to have to admit that I gave you a 5 during voting... but I give you big congratulations for such a well done shot now.  The technicals are wonderful... the composition exquisite and the visual appeal is... a 12.  :D Congratulations on your ribbon!  ', '2014-03-17 18:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7190933, 1104991, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m SO HAPPY to see that this ribboned for you!<br/> <br/>It''s so wonderfully done... so happy... and just a joy to look at.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m SO HAPPY to see that this ribboned for you! It''s so wonderfully done... so happy... and just a joy to look at. ', '2014-03-17 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
